# C073: Builder bookkeeping failure leaves SQLite holding an untracked database pointer
#
# CONFIRMED — static analysis (use-after-close / ownership)
#
# After sqlite3changegroup_schema successfully stores the raw database
# (session.c:2577-2597), weakref creation or dependent-list append can fail.
# The builder remains usable but is not registered for closure before the
# Connection, allowing later use of a closed database.  Requires fault
# injection to trigger weakref/list append failure.
